{"unit_id":"jackovibe__dsh-settings-order#card-zh","repo":"jackovibe/dsh-settings-order","commit":"ca60b30b21750a3c4636b5e0c0589936c9f480a6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-settings-order（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为 DeepSeek Harness 的设置对话框左侧导航提供自定义排序。它通过客户端模块挂载到设置界面，调整已经渲染的导航行，并将顺序保存到宿主设置配置。主要功能包括拖动行排序、使用 Alt+↑/↓ 调整聚焦行、用页脚箭头移动当前页面，以及恢复内置顺序；无法访问宿主设置时使用浏览器 localStorage。适合希望按个人习惯整理 DSH 设置页的 Web 用户。需要已安装 DSH Web GUI 和可用 profile，不需要 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-9","src/client-src.js:434-450","src/client-src.js:518-540"]}
{"unit_id":"jackovibe__dsh-settings-order#card-en","repo":"jackovibe/dsh-settings-order","commit":"ca60b30b21750a3c4636b5e0c0589936c9f480a6","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-settings-order lets DSH Web users reorder the Settings navigation. Drag rows, use Alt+Up/Down, move the active page with footer arrows, or restore the built-in order. It saves settings on the host or in browser localStorage. Requires DSH Web GUI and a profile.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-9","src/client-src.js:434-450","src/client-src.js:518-540"]}
