{"unit_id":"jackovibe__dsh-settings-order#feature-1","repo":"jackovibe/dsh-settings-order","commit":"ca60b30b21750a3c4636b5e0c0589936c9f480a6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-settings-order 的功能「设置导航拖动排序」：拖动设置导航中的一行并放到目标位置，插入位置会显示提示线；放下后新顺序会被保存。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client-src.js:585-640"]}
