{"unit_id":"jackovibe__dsh-settings-order#feature-3","repo":"jackovibe/dsh-settings-order","commit":"ca60b30b21750a3c4636b5e0c0589936c9f480a6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-settings-order 的功能「页脚按钮移动当前页面」：使用导航页脚的 ↑ / ↓ 按钮移动当前选中的设置页；当顺序已自定义时，可选择恢复内置顺序。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client-src.js:486-515","src/client-src.js:518-540"]}
{"unit_id":"jackovibe__dsh-settings-order#feature-4","repo":"jackovibe/dsh-settings-order","commit":"ca60b30b21750a3c4636b5e0c0589936c9f480a6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-settings-order 的功能「保存并恢复导航顺序」：插件优先通过宿主设置服务保存顺序；宿主服务不可用时，将顺序保存在当前浏览器的 localStorage。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client-src.js:186-205","src/client-src.js:274-321"]}
